ibution of the U.S. population of health care personnel by occupation, age, sex, race/ethnicity, work setting, and Census region.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"While the estimates reported here have variance, there has been no attempt to quantify the size of the variance.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Vaccination coverage estimate not reliable because the sample size was <30.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}